          "environment_issues_confirmed": false,
          "screenshot_evidence": "DOM_MODEL_STATE_INDEX: 2 (URL: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/releases/tag/v1.63.0, Title: \"Release v1.63.0 · microsoft/playwright · GitHub\") shows multiple concrete release-note items under the v1.63.0 release entry. Visible text includes two distinct change headings and their descriptions:\n- \"🔒 Test locks\" followed by: \"Tests that access a shared resource — an external service, a global account setting — can now declare a named lock. Tests that share a lock name never run concurrently, across files, workers and projects...\" and an example snippet: \"test ( 'update user settings' , { lock : 'user-settings' } ... // never runs at the same time as other tests holding 'user-settings'\".\n- \"🪟 Locate across frames\" followed by: \"... called without a selector search in any frame of the subtree, so you no longer need to locate the iframe first:\" and an example: \"await page . frameLocator ( ) . getByRole ( 'button' ) . click ( ) ;\".\nThis DOM snapshot provides explicit evidence for at least two distinct changes attributable to the v1.63.0 release notes (test locks; locating across frames). It does not, within the provided snapshot, show a third distinct change item.",
